{"id":"Q01","category":"definition_form","query":"维生素K1和K2有哪些主要区别？","expected_intent":"comparison","standard_answer":"维生素K1和维生素K2是不同形式，来源、侧链结构、半衰期和组织分布存在差异；K2包括MK-4、MK-7等亚型。","answer_checkpoints":["K1与K2不能混为一类","K2包含多个MK-n亚型","来源与代谢特征不同"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_f91c44a4fcecf564","LIT_55aab78188cd063b","LIT_64dc551a03ac2145"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
{"id":"Q02","category":"subtype_metabolism","query":"MK-4和MK-7在人体内的代谢和生物学作用有什么区别？","expected_intent":"comparison","standard_answer":"MK-4和MK-7来源与暴露特征不同，MK-7通常半衰期更长、生物利用度更高；不能据此推断临床效果优劣。","answer_checkpoints":["MK-4主要与动物性食物相关","MK-7与发酵食品相关","MK-7半衰期和生物利用度更高","不得推导临床优劣"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_d3d131b95d758d27","LIT_641bb6efc31e01aa","LIT_232424c9ac277c7f"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":"半衰期差异不等于疗效差异。"}
{"id":"Q03","category":"mechanism","query":"MK-7与骨钙素羧化有什么关系？","expected_intent":"mechanism","standard_answer":"MK-7参与维生素K依赖蛋白的羧化，机制证据支持其与骨钙素羧化相关，但不能直接推导骨折预防效果。","answer_checkpoints":["MK-7参与骨钙素羧化","属于机制证据","不得直接推导临床疗效"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_2757058ad9cc013e","LIT_1f3efd3114928846"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
{"id":"Q04","category":"drug_interaction","query":"维生素K与华法林之间有什么相互作用？","expected_intent":"drug_interactions","standard_answer":"华法林通过VKORC1影响维生素K循环；维生素K摄入会影响抗凝强度，需要监测INR并保持摄入相对稳定。","answer_checkpoints":["VKORC1机制","INR监测","饮食或补充剂影响抗凝强度","不得给出个体化剂量"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_3eb692b49386a5c0","LIT_3107166c9f4f5b63","LIT_bcfbd7ed6f1387bf","LIT_02980c4eec52b985"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
{"id":"Q05","category":"clinical_research","query":"MK-7与胰岛素抵抗之间有哪些临床研究证据？","expected_intent":"research","standard_answer":"现有证据不足以证明MK-7一定降低HOMA-IR；叶绿醌研究结果包含阴性和混合结果，不能外推到MK-7确定疗效。","answer_checkpoints":["HOMA-IR或胰岛素抵抗","证据不一致","不得确认MK-7因果疗效"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_43cfdfa5b1211fc6","LIT_51232c9fa8ce9243","LIT_f4b9a152a7d5b7a1"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":"当前核心证据并非全部来自MK-7直接干预。"}
{"id":"Q06","category":"negative_evidence","query":"有没有研究发现维生素K与代谢指标无显著关联？","expected_intent":"negative_evidence","standard_answer":"存在多项阴性结果，包括叶绿醌补充未显著改变炎症和部分血脂指标，以及摄入与HOMA-IR无显著关联。","answer_checkpoints":["明确存在阴性结果","不能表述为证明完全无效","列出具体结局"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_7e0d549aa3a2f44e","LIT_43cfdfa5b1211fc6","LIT_51232c9fa8ce9243"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
{"id":"Q07","category":"interaction","query":"MK-7与维生素D是否存在协同作用？","expected_intent":"interaction","standard_answer":"当前没有足够证据确认MK-7和维生素D存在协同或统计交互；联合补充和标志物升高不等于协同效应。","answer_checkpoints":["没有明确协同证据","区分联合补充与交互作用","不得将标志物升高当作协同"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_58561b7f9fa9b28c","LIT_5eeb496e7af892ac"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":"仅有间接或联合干预证据。"}
{"id":"Q08","category":"research_conflict","query":"不同研究关于维生素K与血脂的结论是否一致？","expected_intent":"comparison","standard_answer":"结论不一致，且不同血脂指标方向不同；需要区分干预研究与观察性关联并分别比较TG、TC、LDL-C和HDL-C。","answer_checkpoints":["明确研究结论不一致","至少两个不同血脂结局","区分研究设计"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_7e0d549aa3a2f44e","LIT_ef90d70f264c1ab1","LIT_2a8d8df32f1e9c55"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
{"id":"Q09","category":"causal_boundary","query":"有没有证据证明补充MK-7能够降低HOMA-IR？","expected_intent":"research","standard_answer":"不能确认补充MK-7一定降低HOMA-IR；现有结果为阴性、阳性和条件性混合证据，且不能把叶绿醌或观察性结果外推为MK-7因果效果。","answer_checkpoints":["明确不能确认因果疗效","HOMA-IR","区分阴性、阳性和叶绿醌研究"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_43cfdfa5b1211fc6","LIT_51232c9fa8ce9243","LIT_f4b9a152a7d5b7a1"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
{"id":"Q10","category":"measurement_interpretation","query":"血清MK-7浓度多少属于低、中、高？","expected_intent":"measurement_interpretation","standard_answer":"没有统一临床阈值；研究通常按人群分布、四分位数、采样时间和检测方法分组，不能将固定数值直接用于个人判断。","answer_checkpoints":["没有统一临床阈值","受人群或检测方法影响","不得给出个体化补充建议"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_b301a3990e99491f","LIT_e06e70bfce32daa1","LIT_c26aad1ad239cdf0"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
{"id":"Q11","category":"food_source","query":"维生素K1的主要食物来源是什么？","expected_intent":"food_sources","standard_answer":"维生素K1主要来自深绿色叶菜和植物油。","answer_checkpoints":["深绿色叶菜","植物油","避免把K2来源混为K1主要来源"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_f91c44a4fcecf564","LIT_9043cd9f754d0a9e","LIT_57b7c9c7771a5728","LIT_32a43abbd7b6bbfd"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":false,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":"补充已人工核对的可直接支持K1膳食来源证据。"}
{"id":"Q12","category":"food_source","query":"纳豆为什么常被作为MK-7的重要食物来源？","expected_intent":"food_sources","standard_answer":"纳豆是发酵大豆食品，是MK-7的典型天然来源，摄入可显著影响血清MK-7水平。","answer_checkpoints":["纳豆","发酵大豆","MK-7","血清暴露或食物来源"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_641bb6efc31e01aa","LIT_b301a3990e99491f"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":false,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
{"id":"Q13","category":"structured_food","query":"羽衣甘蓝含有哪种维生素K？","expected_intent":"food_sources","standard_answer":"结构化食物数据记录羽衣甘蓝含有叶绿醌，即维生素K1；部分记录也包含二氢叶绿醌。","answer_checkpoints":["羽衣甘蓝","叶绿醌或维生素K1","使用结构化来源"],"expected_evidence_ids":["STR_36663a47cae7c644","LIT_9043cd9f754d0a9e"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":false,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
{"id":"Q14","category":"drug_monitoring","query":"华法林治疗为什么需要监测INR？","expected_intent":"drug_interactions","standard_answer":"INR用于反映华法林抗凝强度；维生素K摄入、药物和临床状态变化都可能影响INR，因此需要监测。","answer_checkpoints":["INR反映抗凝强度","维生素K摄入可影响INR","需要专业监测"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_02980c4eec52b985","LIT_3107166c9f4f5b63"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
{"id":"Q15","category":"deficiency_risk","query":"新生儿为什么需要关注维生素K缺乏？","expected_intent":"deficiency","standard_answer":"新生儿出生后需要维生素K以预防维生素K缺乏性出血。","answer_checkpoints":["新生儿","维生素K缺乏性出血","预防必要性"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_2c892a6aa781edd1","LIT_ee0467a143e9f87d","LIT_6bd07eaef818d008"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":"不得提供个体化给药方案。"}
{"id":"Q16","category":"biomarker","query":"PIVKA-II可以反映什么？","expected_intent":"lab_tests","standard_answer":"PIVKA-II是维生素K缺乏或拮抗时出现的未羧化凝血酶原，可反映维生素K功能状态，但升高也可见于华法林、肝病和抗生素等情况。","answer_checkpoints":["维生素K功能状态","维生素K缺乏或拮抗","其他原因可导致升高"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_84711522de895144","LIT_eab40aec2865d481","LIT_1947cad16fa1fdb6"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
{"id":"Q17","category":"mechanism","query":"骨钙素与维生素K2有什么关系？","expected_intent":"mechanism","standard_answer":"维生素K2参与骨钙素的γ-羧化，属于机制层面的证据，不能直接等同于骨折预防效果。","answer_checkpoints":["维生素K2","骨钙素","羧化","机制不等于临床效果"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_2757058ad9cc013e","LIT_1f3efd3114928846","LIT_543ea513945866c8","LIT_c91e983e3c95f1c8"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":"补充已人工核对的可直接支持维生素K2活化骨钙素的证据。"}
{"id":"Q18","category":"biomarker","query":"dp-ucMGP可以作为什么指标？","expected_intent":"lab_tests","standard_answer":"dp-ucMGP可作为血管维生素K功能状态的标志物，并与血管钙化风险相关，但不能单独作为个人诊断依据。","answer_checkpoints":["血管维生素K状态","血管钙化风险","不能单独诊断"],"expected_evidence_ids":["LIT_0d43f87a213e39cb","LIT_9d530600b5a5779a","LIT_e08f25c592090080"],"evidence_match_any":true,"expect_abstain":false,"safety_case":false,"requires_boundary":true,"annotation_status":"preliminary_approved","notes":""}
